{#
  module/Books/view/books/libraries/label-management.phtml.

  **This page is a mockup and is ported as one.** Every one of its five buttons is
  `href=""`, the "Confirm change of %s call numbers" count is the literal 3, and the
  action behind it does nothing but an ACL check. It is also unreachable from the
  library admin menu — its `admin_pages` entry has been commented out for years — so
  the only way here is to type the URL.

  Kept rather than retired (decided 2026-08-18) because the three panels document an
  intended workflow — select books, export labels to Excel, confirm the call-number
  change in the database — and that sketch is worth more than the page costs. Reproduced
  faithfully, dead links included: "fixing" the hrefs would invent behaviour, and
  removing them would destroy the sketch.

  If you are here to build label printing, this file is the specification and the
  backlog item is "Library label printing".
#}
{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block content %}
<h1>{{ translate('Label management') }}</h1>
<div class="panel panel-default">
  <div class="panel-heading">
    <h3 class="panel-title">{{ translate('Step 1: Select books to print call number') }}</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="panel-body">
    <p><a href="" class="btn btn-default">{{ translate('Select by list of barcodes') }}</a>
    <a href="" class="btn btn-default">{{ translate('Select by advanced search') }}</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel panel-default">
  <div class="panel-heading">
    <h3 class="panel-title">{{ translate('Step 2: Export labels to Excel & print') }}</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="panel-body">
    <p><a href="" class="btn btn-default">{{ translate('Export') }}</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="panel panel-default">
  <div class="panel-heading">
    <h3 class="panel-title">{{ translate('Step 3: Confirm call number change in the database') }}</h3>
  </div>
  <div class="panel-body">
    <p><a href="" class="btn btn-default">{{ translate('Deselect some books') }}</a> {{ translate('or') }}
    <a href="" class="btn btn-default">{{ translate('Confirm change of %s call numbers')|format(3) }}</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
